# synthetic agent chatter and instigation-study candidate seeds / registry are adversarial test data
# (post bodies, authors, generated board seeds); keep every copy out of the tree. The only published
# instigation artifact is site/public/data/instigation/scoreboard.json (numbers + opaque ids only).
data/synthetic-agent-chatter/
data/instigation/
