# .tar.gz and the `latest` pointer live under data/synthetic-agent-chatter/dataset/ (ignored above). Stray copies
# elsewhere are ignored too; tools/leakgate.py fails closed (E_TRACKED) if any of them is force-added.
*.chatter.json
swarmpit-instigation*
